cron is significantly more infectious  than previous covert strains limited  targeted lockdowns work for china before  but because of omicron these outbreaks  are getting out of control china has  fully vaccinated around 88 of its  population with a massive 11.5 billion  doses given out  but those are all homegrown chinese  vaccines less effective than western  mrna jabs which china has refused to use  many elderly vulnerable people have not  even been fully vaccinated china's  intensive care system is underdeveloped  and not ready to deal with a massive  wave of admissions  all that means more serious cases of  covert 19 and more lockdowns  [Music]  some of this is science but much of it  is politics chinese officials have spent  the pandemic loudly criticizing western  democracy's handling of coven 19 saying  dynamic coveted zero points to the  superiority of the chinese system  reversing from that is very difficult so  this isn't just a public health policy  it's political ideology and that means  this is going to be live for people here  for a long while to come
 

